This testdef is ued to test a stealth feature in mpassi introduced by
PR #8957. It uses mpassi namelist variables to turn on the omega-style
frazil coupling model:
   config_frazil_coupling_type = 'omega-fluxes'
   config_ocean_surface_type = 'free'
   config_salt_flux_coupling_type = 'prognostic'
Note that all settings are required. It will have an impact on all
mpassi runs.
